  "notes": "DRAFT by Claude (s345) for Ben to move in the Map Workshop. GAYA = a gold-and-lantern hill town on a cross of two avenues: PILGRIM WAY runs north up to the castle and south over the gorge bridge to Meditation Canyon; LANTERN ROW runs west to the Gaya Open stadium and east up the Mountain Path to the cut face + the cave. Four streets make the grid (Gold St, Violet St, Bell Lane, Steam Lane). One U-shaped CARAVAN ROAD round the west, south and east edges from the Sky Dock. NPC keys are draft (from the brief) until the 2D file comes in."
 },
